Anteater Poker - Installation Instructions

//=============================================================================
Developer Installation & Build (Source Package)
//=============================================================================
To compile the system from source code, execute the following:

1. Extract the Source Archive:
* tar -xvzf Poker_Alpha.src.tar.gz
* cd poker

2. Compile the Binaries:
* make all

3. Run Offline GUI Tests (verify GTK rendering without server):
* make test-gui

//=============================================================================
Customer Installation & Execution (End-User Package)
//=============================================================================
The customer package contains pre-compiled binaries. No compilation is required.

1. Extract the Application:
* tar -xvzf Poker_Alpha.tar.gz
* cd poker

2. Launch the Host Server:
* ./bin/poker_server

3. Launch the Client GUI:
* ./bin/poker_client